      "source_fingerprint": "b2e466e9d4c06b41091b72f6f57b166eea1c6e69f9cd561f38649cf660da9c8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:382d197d5a1564914f15afe1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦ー吼吼吼！\r\n没有什么是我圣王办不到的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "54c3e663d41f3712dbd1f818464679f390e14a763ad849fb7cf4ad37283d9d92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34cffa266b4884a2d9489edd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵呵，心情真好！\r\n现在就赋予你向一流的圣王\r\n提出一流指示的权利吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d641ed40ea7e3351175749052ace73a1b657d8cf17af875882f950c308c28572",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afabf2becb29a6e7833b9166",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，我赋予你公布今天行程的权利！\r\n向我提出最完美的建议吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "735e24ff457362184f859cc79fdbc86ac095f84e2d9c6ba4420dc72b3a44975d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16dd86ed76c8d7978bd8f15a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到了提升圣王才能的时间了！\r\n你可要好好动用你的头脑才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbf0ecbf2013785b33cc729b5118d1702a243e411aa4b0c1c5bd075cf228de26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8da19db692dfc691420b1f4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "所以呢？我该做些什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b40cd3e7e1d954b40ca1028cbcb9b30b55bf5138d1f91624684b6e1a177440c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:400ed266de362cf35ccd0db3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快，要开始训练了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91155856acf738951728c9695da2a31fb0f0d02c359bf7e05cf7cfc38abe4476",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ee5eabc8649c8a7567312f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……不行，没办法保持集中力。\r\n看来无论圣王再完美，\r\n都还是需要转换心情呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9fa1f32af779051baba459974075c8ace9bdd3d1c34569f35bfb28c82dc0206",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6a15d06ffc16dd2ab03ea0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "签约赛马娘的情绪管理\r\n也是你的工作吧。\r\n喂，做点什么有趣的事情吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b603568e371b84271e6a168677dfeb2d50f1b00a9376b7271762c69453f65dd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7345e8577038dc5fb630f3da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我并不是不高兴什么的……\r\n只是心情上提不起劲而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "faee43b78a018d19eccd87cd21d69c3520b532f32b09e7fad15cb8575423837b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63d2ded1dc01099cda7df4f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……放弃这种事，\r\n我是绝不可能允许的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "527939e54083ff7dbc25ca83f66450c2f406b199545ff4d03a59f2c78e578c11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d77e1010a0f9b19349c564c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一直参赛反而变得没办法\r\n发现自己的疲劳……\r\n这对繁忙的我来说可是一大问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7ba28024a369cf57a2b3d08ad417a3e1dff0a2534d73159ea1df616cec3c8b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7a19e810582d53fff34cdaf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要挑战是可以，\r\n但只知道一味地参赛是很愚蠢的。\r\n知道吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "af0807c2bc531dfccf9c99bcae8e14976713692dc6e406b4198c0bd5a780bb01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f49a9f9d3d60f3d67bae298",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦ー吼吼吼！\r\n除了我以外还有谁能拿第一名呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "05cca36999496619e3c427f335d1ae7f0977b0c6987543cf584526f7459f2bc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9c571ba95a915ba80b0494f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论对手是谁都不重要！\r\n因为赢的一定会是我圣王光环！",
      "source_fingerprint": "867aaedb3391ee72de472b72a729c5dd88970f7a9be075d01a5921cc0ac67df4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecf10df9a775a4ab157fd7ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态非常完美。\r\n要做的只是向大家展露我的才能！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff8b099d1874c9e4610d79d667709012fef1fc614d2dd587f6c5c2663ceb1943",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c27df8e79d87544b8a194746",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，状态还不错。\r\n你就做好替我欢呼的准备吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c653e50e96ee4da5fb4b23adbf9324c441357e70bf99211615359b62924e61ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00cad463b18af047b7b40cc6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体感觉很轻盈，\r\n也没有什么需要担心的地方。\r\n要做的只是华丽地拿下胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9ac391695219d822dffd08d137530424ca70781d990f3aeb73e54de3fc93177",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1ce025413f38f378b6baedc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我明白，比任何人背负着\r\n更多取胜期望的人是我──\r\n圣王光环！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5753aa5453a239cdd1c2169d5a48705f37a0e581ceeae4d6c31e782d08ca503c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8779a440d8fbf7e36aa03e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我只需要跑出配得上\r\n圣王的成绩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d48d4bab22cf9d47ecc435a6d022b8ecd18f5b7e81489012cb127d258f1379fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4a5fea1645e03eb3b29d29d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们一直都为了今天这个时刻而努力。\r\n我当然要去拿下胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f04a3829cb6df98ed305ec46edf622f72bd3744de1ea4581d174c2b82aa9d959",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f6e2cdcde389c080b0d36e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧，去向大家展示\r\n我一流的跑姿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43909353f6caa0c804e62d660a7a8e21e92b6bf3398336d2f905f3cc3d0691a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24e86269b04cd015bebb3c8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毕竟也不是无时无刻\r\n都能在万全状态下奔跑的……\r\n只能尽力做到最好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a8706aeaea31291714f409c5e7c716f3d4e1189a66f87eab2f4d8acb58609f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a253ccce537abdb10d5db4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这气氛真不好……\r\n但能将这样的气氛一扫而空\r\n才叫做一流！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64009b8cbc280a840926c83ba758e976eddaaea6fb57e57b69852b3c1693a405",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da0281f792a45ac5a8b2a512",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我、我才没有紧张！\r\n我当然是不会有问题的啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6eb621efbc5da8d21bc76a7cc51514d88977176b8e1593c372c969412092e6c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f91dbd2841226f1726f2d0eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论任何时候都要全力以赴。\r\n……这才是我的做法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d54dad825daa94ad12de8536455ae5037ad7c18af944942141ae1c2c7b607f70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83b7a440c4060dab6ea48aba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……什么也别说。\r\n我想要保持无心状态去迎战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96c1ea4c56cf544e9753faff59bf450802f59b2ff85966e8f271ac5e1c22e7f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1aad83ece95b8f673e13f89c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我就是不想放弃所以才会在这里。\r\n……我一定能做到的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d665331d50e433a0ef12511d425f1ce65ce76ef4882b5cba330ea1d863cf639c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10fe4cebce2592dd2a09c469",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上场咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "40c938506ee60c916a2da83f41466b1c7f147d2c4f1100b54dfc723ad9911548",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:869e889ef43187b778d31a62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看好吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d6c405d17a0c835f622b1fda2f009a29104dd775cd1c3269a39c052215931cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ced08255ac371cc071c74937",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当然！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8de9dab381200d6a5564afe676253d4fab8a122da24063cbb74fb60fafacf4e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f823c476105e548d5aac90b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦，这样啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec890b0c21db6edd3a69971a693be1e9d94f045e571ea1621d329782945b3ecc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6da415dfdddafb136f5861ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咕……",
      "source_fingerprint": "727c3d354aadc91e3ce724d2a41fcbc84234cc54a17162f2d8758e28db67d1cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20042"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
